{"v":4,"catch":"先生們，這可是件大事！","desc":"《GANGBUSTERS》是 KONAMI 於 1988 年發行的動作射擊遊戲。\n控制 SMITH & WESSON 抓捕 THE DAGRUS MOB，即搶劫 THE GRANT BANK 的團夥。\n使用有限數量的子彈來捕捉 THE RED GANG，並在瞄準最後階段時補充和增強彈藥。\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2025-04-10","genres":["動作","射擊","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f9361ca121ea139c98182ed048afdf898f72e67ba34952e04eab7ab1423f199c.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/7dcb5e6e9a2968541ec696140996331a083689a4c543115b55248a9ebd8619aa.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/798ed9355f98f77e990e0fa0c96622729c00ea5974995619ece75d7413a3e618.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d0311e3ebf8639ccde7eb0302830f4b53e36185596d99b133c306af175fcd2f6.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/9ff26a24c866398ad44ad0c270e7c9642150c200aea179dd7b76de673016c597.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f1a0488e1fe122d945b89ae4a7e2c09260d9af31c43157f72b7815e1476b20b3.jpg"],"titleId":"01005bf021726000","dlc":[]}